Oh, you’re the new hire! I’m Jordan, your supervisor.
Lemme tell you a story back when our president Mr. Angilo started this whole gig. This place wasn't even called Angiloan. It was just a small rural micro-lending office down the street.
Paper-to-pixel, man. We digitized everything last year to scale up, but the old man’s core rule never changed\: \
'A credit score doesn't show character; real trust does.'